<title>UK: TABLE-Midland Bank H1 pretax up 27 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Midland Bank H1 pretax up 27 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Pretax		     829		    vs 651</p>
<p> Net interest income    1,074		  vs 984</p>
<p> Other operating income 913		    vs 786</p>
<p> Operating expenses     1,114		  up 1 pct</p>
<p> Bad and doubtful debt  67		     vs 89</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the HSBC Holdings Plc subsidiary is Midland Bank.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
